-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Version 0.1.0 (2026-11-16)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  * ORDER 631 (Daniel, 2026-11-16: "hi fidelity audio is a must across all audio systems ... it's just default configs"): the sound system follows the rate of what plays
  * Rates from the computer's own devices (HDA codecs, displays' audio blocks, USB DACs), 44100 and 48000 Hz always
  * Conversion quality 14 where the processor carries it, measured, else the highest it carries (never below PipeWire's 4)
  * Triangular dither for devices that take only 16 bit; drop-ins named 00-sparky-stereo-audio.conf, so every file of the person wins
  * Failures are said and kept by sparky-stereo-problems, in ten languages
